+# Finite C17 Field closeout source successor
+
+This source-only test correction preserves the original C16 PR112 published
+metadata and package. It delegates current Field bytes to the existing finite
+`validateFieldPublishedSource` contract, including its exact reviewed d977 author,
+original companions, freshness checks and unknown-edit rejection. No replacement
+hash allowlist, runtime change, budget increase or historical evidence rewrite.
+
+The named closeout case changes from one failure to one pass; 44 other cases stay
+filtered in that focused proof. This does not establish complete Foundation
+coverage, operational authority, hosted acceptance or business-state restoration.
+Release 1.0 remains NOT READY / NOT AUTHORIZED.
